OL,3,GNEWSAStoma-friendly toilets introduced
OL,4,Ain hospitals
OL,5,
OL,6,FRobinson, who has been living with a
OL,7,Fstoma since November 2025, said: "It's
OL,8,Fjust an incredible little change, but
OL,9,Fit's a massive change to all of us."
